msgstr "Skrbniški e-poštni naslov:"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"The system settings were auto-detected. CiviCRM will be installed with:"
msgstr "Sistemske nastavitve so bile samodejno zaznane. CiviCRM bo nameščen z naslednjimi nastavitvami:"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CMS Database"
msgstr "Podatkovna zbirka CMS"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CiviCRM Database"
msgstr "Podatkovna zbirka CiviCRM"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Uveljavi"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"By default, CiviCRM uses the same database as your website. You may install "
"on a separate database if you need more fine-grained control over "
"permissions, replication, hardware capacity, etc."
msgstr "CiviCRM privzeto uporablja isto podatkovno zbirko kot vaše spletno mesto. Če potrebujete podrobnejši nadzor nad dovoljenji, replikacijo, zmogljivostjo strojne opreme itd., ga lahko namestite v ločeno podatkovno zbirko."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "<strong>Example</strong>: <code>%1</code>"
msgstr "<strong>Primer</strong>: <code>%1</code>"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Tip: This uses URL notation. If the credentials require any special "
"characters (e.g. \"&\" or \"#\"), then apply URL encoding (e.g. \"%26\" or "
"\"%23\")."
msgstr "Namig: Tu se uporablja zapis URL. Če prijavni podatki vsebujejo posebne znake (npr. »&« ali »#«), jih kodirajte za URL (npr. »%26« ali »%23«)."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CiviCRM Settings File"
msgstr "Datoteka z nastavitvami CiviCRM"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CiviCRM Source Code"
msgstr "Izvorna koda CiviCRM"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Need more advanced control? You may alternatively use the <a href=\"%1\" "
"target=\"%2\">command-line installer</a>."
msgstr "Potrebujete naprednejši nadzor? Uporabite lahko tudi <a href=\"%1\" target=\"%2\">namestitveni program za ukazno vrstico</a>."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Accept donations and payments"
msgstr "Sprejemanje donacij in plačil"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Accept event registrations"
msgstr "Sprejemanje prijav na dogodke"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Send email blasts and newsletters"
msgstr "Množično pošiljanje e-pošte in e-novic"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Manage recurring memberships"
msgstr "Upravljanje ponavljajočih se članstev"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Track case histories"
msgstr "Spremljanje zgodovine primerov"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Accept pledges"
msgstr "Sprejemanje zavez"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Generate reports"
msgstr "Priprava poročil"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.civi-setup.php
msgid "Organize campaigns, surveys, and petitions"
msgstr "Organiziranje kampanj, anket in peticij"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.tpl.php
msgid "At least one component must be enabled."
msgstr "Omogočena mora biti vsaj ena komponenta."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/components.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Not sure? That's OK. After installing, you can enable and disable components"
" at any time."
msgstr "Niste prepričani? Nič hudega. Po namestitvi lahko komponente kadar koli omogočite ali onemogočite."

