#: setup/plugins/blocks/header.tpl.php
msgid "Version %1"
msgstr "Različica %1"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/header.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Error: Javascipt appears to be disabled. The CiviCRM web-based installer "
"requires Javascript."
msgstr "Napaka: JavaScript je očitno onemogočen. Spletni namestitveni program CiviCRM zahteva JavaScript."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/header.tpl.php setup/src/Setup/UI/SetupController.php
msgid "CiviCRM Installer"
msgstr "Namestitveni program CiviCRM"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/header.tpl.php
msgid "Thanks for choosing CiviCRM! You're nearly there!"
msgstr "Hvala, ker ste izbrali CiviCRM! Do namestitve vas loči le še nekaj korakov!"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/header.tpl.php
msgid "Please follow the instructions below to install CiviCRM."
msgstr "Za namestitev CiviCRM sledite spodnjim navodilom."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/install.tpl.php
msgid "Installing CiviCRM..."
msgstr "Nameščanje CiviCRM ..."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/install.tpl.php
msgid "Install CiviCRM"
msgstr "Namesti CiviCRM"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/install.tpl.php
msgid "(this will take a few minutes)"
msgstr "(to bo trajalo nekaj minut)"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/l10n.tpl.php
msgid "Language and Region"
msgstr "Jezik in regija"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/l10n.tpl.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM can be installed with support for various regions and languages."
msgstr "CiviCRM lahko namestite s podporo za različne regije in jezike."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/l10n.tpl.php
msgid ""
"The initial configuration of the basic data will also be set to that "
"language (ex: individual prefixes, suffixes, activity types) as well as "
"various settings (ex: date/time/address format, default currency). The "
"settings can be changed later. It is also possible to enable multiple "
"languages later on."
msgstr "V izbranem jeziku bodo nastavljeni tudi začetni osnovni podatki (npr. nazivi in pripone oseb ter vrste dejavnosti) in različne nastavitve (npr. oblika datuma, časa in naslova ter privzeta valuta). Nastavitve lahko pozneje spremenite. Pozneje lahko omogočite tudi več jezikov."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/l10n.tpl.php
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%1\" target=\"%2\">Learn more about using CiviCRM language and "
"region settings.</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"%1\" target=\"%2\">Več o uporabi jezikovnih in regionalnih nastavitev CiviCRM.</a>"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/l10n.tpl.php
msgid "Language and Region:"
msgstr "Jezik in regija:"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid "Opt-in"
msgstr "Prostovoljna vključitev"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid ""
"CiviCRM is provided for free -- built with donations and volunteerism. We "
"don't have the marketing or data-analytics prowess of a large corporation, "
"so we rely on users to keep us informed -- and to spread the word."
msgstr "CiviCRM je brezplačen in nastaja s pomočjo donacij in prostovoljnega dela. Nimamo trženjskih in podatkovnoanalitičnih zmogljivosti velikih korporacij, zato se zanašamo na uporabnike, da nam posredujejo informacije in širijo glas o nas."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Of course, not everyone can help in these ways. But if you can, opt-in to "
"help enrich the product and community."
msgstr "Seveda ne more vsak pomagati na te načine. Če lahko, se prostovoljno vključite in pomagajte izboljšati program ter okrepiti skupnost."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid "Version pingback"
msgstr "Sporočanje podatkov o različici"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid "Check for CiviCRM version updates. Report anonymous usage statistics."
msgstr "Preverjaj posodobitve različice CiviCRM. Pošiljaj anonimno statistiko uporabe."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid "Empowered by CiviCRM"
msgstr "Poganja CiviCRM"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/opt-in.tpl.php
msgid "Display \"Empowered by CiviCRM\" in the footer of public forms."
msgstr "Prikaži »Poganja CiviCRM« v nogi javnih obrazcev."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.civi-setup.php
msgid "System"
msgstr "Sistem"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "Sistemske zahteve"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid ""
"We are not able to install the software. Please review the errors and "
"warnings below."
msgstr "Programske opreme ni mogoče namestiti. Preglejte spodnje napake in opozorila."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid ""
"There are some issues that we recommend you look at before installing. "
"However, you are still able to install the software."
msgstr "Priporočamo, da pred namestitvijo pregledate nekaj zaznanih težav. Kljub temu lahko programsko opremo namestite."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid "You're ready to install!"
msgstr "Vse je pripravljeno za namestitev!"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid "Severity"
msgstr "Resnost"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid "Section"
msgstr "Razdelek"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/requirements.tpl.php
msgid "After updating your system, refresh to test the requirements again."
msgstr "Po posodobitvi sistema osvežite stran, da znova preverite izpolnjevanje zahtev."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/sample-data.tpl.php
msgid "Sample Data"
msgstr "Vzorčni podatki"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/sample-data.tpl.php
msgid "Fill system with fake information"
msgstr "Napolni sistem z izmišljenimi podatki"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/sample-data.tpl.php
msgid ""
"To initialize a demo site, load sample data about fake people. Only "
"available in English (United States)."
msgstr "Za vzpostavitev predstavitvenega spletnega mesta naložite vzorčne podatke o izmišljenih osebah. Na voljo so samo v angleščini (Združene države)."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/sync-users.tpl.php
msgid "Synchronize all existing users"
msgstr "Uskladi vse obstoječe uporabnike"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/sync-users.tpl.php
msgid ""
"To help manage communication preferences, each \"<em>%1 User</em>\" should "
"be internally linked to a \"<em>CiviCRM Contact</em>\"."
msgstr "Za lažje upravljanje komunikacijskih nastavitev mora biti vsak »<em>uporabnik sistema %1</em>« interno povezan s »<em>stikom CiviCRM</em>«."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/sync-users.tpl.php
msgid "You may skip this and run synchronization at any time in the future."
msgstr "Ta korak lahko preskočite in usklajevanje izvedete kadar koli pozneje."

#: setup/res/finished.Backdrop.php setup/res/finished.Drupal.php
#: setup/res/finished.Standalone.php setup/res/finished.WordPress.php
#: setup/src/Setup/UI/SetupController.php
msgid "CiviCRM Installed"
msgstr "CiviCRM je nameščen"

#: setup/res/finished.Backdrop.php setup/res/finished.Drupal.php
#: setup/res/finished.Standalone.php setup/res/finished.WordPress.php
msgid "CiviCRM has been successfully installed"
msgstr "CiviCRM je bil uspešno nameščen"

#: setup/res/finished.Backdrop.php
msgid ""
"Backdrop user permissions have been automatically set - giving anonymous and"
" authenticated users access to public CiviCRM forms and features. We "
"recommend that you <a %1>review these permissions</a> to ensure that they "
"are appropriate for your requirements (<a %2>learn more...</a>)"
msgstr "Uporabniška dovoljenja v sistemu Backdrop so bila samodejno nastavljena, tako da imajo anonimni in prijavljeni uporabniki dostop do javnih obrazcev in funkcij CiviCRM. Priporočamo, da <a %1>pregledate ta dovoljenja</a> in preverite, ali ustrezajo vašim zahtevam (<a %2>več informacij ...</a>)"

#: setup/res/finished.Backdrop.php setup/res/finished.Drupal.php
#: setup/res/finished.Standalone.php setup/res/finished.WordPress.php
msgid ""
"Use the <a %1>Configuration Checklist</a> to review and configure settings "
"for your new site"
msgstr "S pomočjo <a %1>seznama nastavitev</a> preglejte in uredite nastavitve novega spletnega mesta"

#: setup/res/finished.Common.php
msgid ""
"Have you registered this site at CiviCRM.org? If not, please help strengthen"
" the CiviCRM ecosystem by taking a few minutes to <a %1>fill out the site "
"registration form</a>. The information collected will help us prioritize "
"improvements, target our communications and build the community. If you have"
" a technical role for this site, be sure to check Keep in Touch to receive "
"technical updates (a low volume mailing list)."
msgstr "Ali ste to spletno mesto že registrirali na CiviCRM.org? Če ga še niste, si vzemite nekaj minut in <a %1>izpolnite obrazec za registracijo spletnega mesta</a> ter tako pomagajte okrepiti ekosistem CiviCRM. Zbrane informacije nam bodo pomagale določiti prednostne izboljšave, prilagoditi obveščanje in graditi skupnost. Če skrbite za tehnične vidike tega spletnega mesta, označite možnost »Ostanimo v stiku« (Keep in Touch), da boste prejemali tehnična obvestila (poštni seznam z majhnim številom sporočil)."

#: setup/res/finished.Common.php
msgid ""
"We have integrated KCFinder with CKEditor and TinyMCE. This allows a user to"
" upload images. All uploaded images are public."
msgstr "KCFinder smo povezali z urejevalnikoma CKEditor in TinyMCE, kar uporabnikom omogoča nalaganje slik. Vse naložene slike so javno dostopne."

#: setup/res/finished.Drupal.php
msgid ""
"Drupal user permissions have been automatically set - giving anonymous and "
"authenticated users access to public CiviCRM forms and features. We "
"recommend that you <a %1>review these permissions</a> to ensure that they "
"are appropriate for your requirements (<a %2>learn more...</a>)"
msgstr "Uporabniška dovoljenja v sistemu Drupal so bila samodejno nastavljena, tako da imajo anonimni in prijavljeni uporabniki dostop do javnih obrazcev in funkcij CiviCRM. Priporočamo, da <a %1>pregledate ta dovoljenja</a> in preverite, ali ustrezajo vašim zahtevam (<a %2>več informacij ...</a>)"

#: setup/res/finished.Standalone.php
msgid "Continue to the CiviCRM Dashboard"
msgstr "Nadaljuj na nadzorno ploščo CiviCRM"

#: setup/res/finished.WordPress.php
msgid ""
"WordPress user permissions have been automatically set - giving Anonymous "
"and Subscribers access to public CiviCRM forms and features. We recommend "
"that you <a %1>review these permissions</a> to ensure that they are "
"appropriate for your requirements (<a %2>learn more...</a>)"
msgstr "Uporabniška dovoljenja v WordPressu so bila samodejno nastavljena, tako da imajo anonimni uporabniki in naročniki dostop do javnih obrazcev in funkcij CiviCRM. Priporočamo, da <a %1>pregledate ta dovoljenja</a> in preverite, ali ustrezajo vašim zahtevam (<a %2>več informacij ...</a>)"
